<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Klamath County, Ore.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Klamath County, Ore.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it received the written award on $15.300 million of Klamath County, Ore., general obligation bonds, series 1997, with a top yield of 5.35 percent in 2011.</p>
